---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms and Conditions" description="Terms and Conditions of Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — how you may use this website and its content.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 26 November 2026</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>Acceptance</h2>
			<p>By using rozgar-raasta-pakistan.vercel.app you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
			<h2>What this site is</h2>
			<p>Rozgar Raasta Pakistan is an information publication. We provide job listings, course information, scholarships and career guides for general information. We are not an employer, a recruitment agency, a university or a government body.</p>
			<h2>Accuracy</h2>
			<p>We verify opportunities against official sources and show the verification date, but details can change. Always confirm the deadline, eligibility and procedure on the official website before applying. We are not responsible for changes made by the official source after our verification date.</p>
			<h2>No guarantee</h2>
			<p>We do not guarantee employment, admission, a scholarship, or any income. Nothing on this site is a promise of a job or money.</p>
			<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
			<p>You may read, share links to, and quote our content with credit. You may not copy whole articles and republish them as your own, scrape the site aggressively, or use it to mislead others.</p>
			<h2>External links</h2>
			<p>Links to other websites are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for their content, availability or policies.</p>
			<h2>Liability</h2>
			<p>The site is provided "as is". We are not liable for losses arising from reliance on listings or guides, or from third-party websites, employers or platforms.</p>
			<h2>Changes</h2>
			<p>We may update these terms. The date above shows the latest version.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
